#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:86 24a5b508f6124d25818d95ac05bd0dc9
msgid ""
"名称用户可以自定义，主机选项中输入“服务ssh“显示的服务外部地址，端口号填写“服务ssh”中的端口号，协议使用默认的SFTP，用户名和密码填写cnSRC的用户名和密码。点击”连接“。"
msgstr ""
"You can customize the name. In the host field, enter the external service "
"address shown under \"Service SSH\"; enter the port number from \"Service "
"SSH\"; use the default SFTP protocol; enter your cnSRC username and "
"password. Click \"Connect\"."

